        "He looked towards the dark window, their shadows floating above the lawn reflected on the glass.",
        "\"Your father always described the trust structure as a 'remnant of the Middle Ages.'\"",
        "\"He even denounced the parking rules at his regular clubs as relics of the Middle Ages.\"",
        "\"He was always testing me, intentionally or unintentionally, asking me if I could directly take power in the future.\"",
        "\"He is worried that you will never be able to hold power in your lifetime!\"",
        "\"Why should he worry about this?\"",
        "\"Why should I marry you?\"",
        "Adrian snapped back to look at her.",
        "Celia placed the earrings heavily on the table. \"Whenever someone asks you if your father controlled your life, the first thing that comes to your mind is 'greed.'\"",
        "\"It's not fair for you to say that.\"",
        "\"Yeah, it's really unfair.\"",
        "“I accused Helena in public just because she was the one holding the envelope!”",
        "\"It's because over the years, you have been eager to find a scapegoat and put all your grievances on her.\"",
        "He stood up abruptly.",
        "Celia's eyes were red, but she managed not to let the tears fall. \"See, that's it. As soon as someone exposes the truth that you know well, you turn around and run away.\"",
