        "\"That's not an answer,\" he said.",
        "\"That's the only honest answer I can give right now.\"",
        "He fled the room before she could see the pain in his eyes.",
        "By midnight, the manor was empty except for the police, lawyers, a few key servants, and four people who just a few hours ago thought they knew each other.",
        "Police found Mrs. Kline at Norwalk Hospital. Her husband did suffer a heart attack at 6:58 in the evening. Hospital surveillance and parking records confirmed she arrived around 7:20, around the time Adrian made his allegation. There was no way she could have snuck back into the break room and stolen the envelope after the accusation.",
        "But she admitted that she opened the cardboard box where the stationery was stored at 5:15.",
        "She also admitted that she noticed at that time that an envelope with a dark navy blue seal was missing.",
        "But she didn't report it.",
        "When Officer Ruiz asked why, Mrs. Kline said she thought Margot had taken it away early to decorate the patio. And Margot insisted that she went to get it at five forty.",
        "This time difference left a full twenty-five minutes blank.",
        "Security surveillance showed that during this period, Helena entered the morning room twice, Margot three times, Mrs. Kline once, Charles' administrative assistant twice, two florists, a lighting technician, three waiters, and - Celia's father, Thomas Markham.",
        "Thomas walked in alone at 5:27 and stayed inside for a full four minutes.",
        "Celia is in the library staring at the surveillance footage.",
        "\"My father was looking for Charles,\" she argued.",
        "Charles, standing behind Daniel's chair, sneered: \"Looking for it in the morning lounge?\"",
        "\"He had no idea where everyone was.\"",
        "“He was involved in activities at the estate for twelve years.”",
        "\"Then he might have gone the wrong way!\"",
        "In the video, Daniel pressed the pause button the moment Thomas exited the room. His hands were empty.",
        "Helena leaned closer to the screen. \"Go back a little.\"",
        "Daniel fell back for a few seconds.",
        "When Thomas entered, his suit jacket was buttoned. When I came out, the buttons were undone.",
        "\"This proves nothing at all.\" Celia gritted her teeth.",
        "\"Indeed,\" Helena agreed, \"it can't be proven.\"",
        "Adrian is standing by the bookshelf. He had not spoken a word to Celia since the argument in the breakfast room. The ring on her finger is still there.",
        "Officer Ruiz asked if Thomas could be asked to cooperate in taking a transcript. Celia dialed his number.",
        "He answered instantly.",
        "\"What are they doing to you?\" he said loud enough for Adrian to hear.",
        "\"Dad, why did you go to the morning lounge before the dinner started?\"",
        "Dead silence.",
        "\"I'm looking for Charles.\"",
        "\"What are you looking for him for?\"",
        "\"Want to talk to him privately.\"",
        "\"What to talk about?\"",
        "There was another moment of silence.",
        "\"About the agreement.\"",
        "Everyone in the library immediately pricked up their ears.",
        "Celia closed her eyes. \"What about the agreement?\"",
        "\"I wanted him to know that I had some concerns about it.\"",
        "\"What concerns?\"",
        "\"I couldn't tell you on the phone.\"",
