        "Adrian kept looking hard at her face.",
        "How he wished he could feel that pure and strong sense of certainty at this moment. Like his unmistakable instinct when he accused Helena on the terrace. He wished he could stand up for her without hesitation.",
        "But that feeling didn't come.",
