        "\"Shut up.\"",
        "She took a large step back before he could reach for her.",
        "There was a moment of embarrassment on Charles's face, but Celia didn't let him go and fired at him first.",
        "\"Before there was any conclusive evidence, you were convinced that my family was plotting evil against your business empire; but when faced with the irrefutable evidence that your trustee abused his power, you repeatedly whitewashed the situation. Now, just because I walked into a damn room, you can't wait to pin the charge of 'stealing legal documents' on me.\"",
        "\"I was just asking as a matter of routine.\"",
