        "The sensational investigation lasted a full six weeks.",
        "Owen was formally charged with multiple felony counts of wire fraud, computer crimes, tampering with physical evidence, and attempted fraudulent transfer. The indictment details how he stole Helena's security credentials to send a fatal transfer notice and deliberately altered top-secret documents about the dinner in an effort to create a public relations disaster that would bring down both Helena and Charles.",
        "Thomas faces serious charges of conspiracy and obstruction of justice after police recovered completely deleted chats from Owen's spare phone. Those records provide irrefutable evidence that Thomas not only knew that Owen planned to stuff the transfer documents into the exhibition agreement, but even fanned the flames and encouraged him to make the matter bigger and make it \"hard to recover.\"",
