        "Before the special committee could complete the recall process, Helena submitted her resignation with great dignity. In her resignation letter, she took full responsibility, admitting that she failed to obtain the informed consent of her client, abused a governance mechanism full of conflicts of interest, and allowed her fear of the family to lose control, overriding transparent and compliant legal procedures.",
        "But she never admitted the word \"fraud\" from beginning to end.",
