        "It was a single-shot marine distress flare. It was designed so that the burning light could be seen from miles away. If this thing is launched in a closed room, it may ignite carpets, curtains, or even directly ignite Daniel's clothes at any time. The blow just now was less than a foot away from the large solid wood bookshelf.",
        "He twisted the empty cartridge case between his two fingers and kept turning it.",
