        "Daniel looked at Ruth, as if the seventeen years between them had been completely reset at this moment.",
        "When she first met him, he was twenty-five years old and newly married. At that time, he was just a junior property assistant wearing a cheap suit. He was used to recording every instruction from his boss in detail in a small black notebook. It was Ruth who taught him step by step: which mahogany doors would jam in humid summers, which trust directors would go crazy after drinking too much at dinner parties, and when Howard condescendingly asked you to provide \"advice,\" how should you use the most humble terms to package \"absolute obedience\" into the answer he wanted.",
