        "\"Because she didn't take anything with her when she left. Because Julian ordered the servants to throw all her things into the storage room. Because mother said that anything bought with the Sterling family's money was not allowed to be taken away.\"",
        "\"Most of the things in here were bought before she and Julian got married.\"",
        "\"I know.\"",
        "\"Of course you do.\"",
        "Beatrice winced suddenly.",
        "Very good.",
        "\"You knew he was hurting her?\"",
        "She stood up suddenly. \"I didn't know it would be this serious.\"",
        "\"Sit down.\"",
