        "\"You think as long as everyone keeps smiling, it's not violence.\"",
        "She wiped the corners of her eyes angrily.",
        "\"When we were kids, if I got in trouble with Julian, he would lock me in the cabana by the pool. Mum said I was too sensitive. Dad said I needed to be tougher. One time, Julian broke my wrist trying to grab a tennis racket, and Mum told everyone that I had fallen off a horse.\"",
        "The room fell silent.",
        "Here we go again.",
        "Such a sad legacy.",
        "Cruelty, like silverware, is passed down from generation to generation in this family.",
        "Beatrice let out a short, bitter laugh. \"So, no, Mrs. Valentine, I have no idea what normal life is like. I know Chloe looks scared, but fearful women are all too common in our family.\"",
        "I finally sat down.",
        "Not because she deserves forgiveness.",
        "It's because the truth has already entered the room, and the truth cannot be rushed.",
        "\"Would you be willing to prove this under oath in court?\"",
        "Her face instantly turned pale.",
        "\"I can't.\"",
        "\"Then you came today just to make yourself feel better.\"",
        "“I’m here because I’m trying to do something.”",
