        "And Emma is always the one who must take responsibility.",
        "After school, she helps her father in the family's small real estate agency. She takes care of Kevin while her parents are busy. She remembers everyone's birthdays, pays bills scrupulously when the family's cash flow is tight, and stays silent when Kevin takes credit from her.",
        "Their father, William Blake, saw it all.",
        "Before he died, he said something to Emma that she would never forget.",
