        "It's not a big fuss, it's not a hoarse voice, and it's not a clumsy trick that can be seen through at a glance. Ethan's lies were hidden in gentle corrections and high-sounding explanations. He lied with flowers after an argument, lied with concern when he cared about my account password, lied with control disguised as deep love.",
        "And I once longed to be loved.",
