        "Within an hour, Aunt Lena contacted her old friend Naomi Price, a senior family law attorney with a voice as steady and capable as hardened steel. Without saying a word, Naomi directly asked me to send her copies of the recording, police number, photos, screenshots, real estate documents, and any documents that Ethan asked me to sign.",
        "\"Don't meet him alone,\" Naomi warned, \"and don't answer the phone. All communications must be written down, preferably through me. Also, contact your bank immediately to freeze any sharing permissions.\"",
