        "## Chapter 6: My Father's Letter",
        "\"Where did you get this?\" I asked in a low voice.",
        "\"Your father gave it to me before he died,\" Naomi said. \"He told me to take it out only under three circumstances.\"",
        "\"What's going on?\"",
