        "In his state of confusion, he kept asking the nurse where Michael was until late the next night.",
        "When he finally woke up enough to understand that Theo was my son, not his own, he cried so desperately that the medical staff had to lightly sedate him.",
        "My mother always said this to everyone, which just proved that he never meant any harm.",
