        "Theo?",
        "Michael?",
        "The son he lost?",
        "The grandson he almost stole from the world?",
        "The court ordered that he be placed in long-term closed memory care, with limited supervised visitation and no contact with minors without court approval. Due to the pending further evaluation of his mental condition, criminal prosecution has been suspended, but the protection order remains in effect.",
