        "## Chapter 3: The Files Behind the Toast",
        "The party never went on.",
        "No music played again.",
        "The cake couldn't be cut either.",
        "Guests were allowed to leave after the security team took down everyone's names and copied personal video backups.",
        "Of course, no one was forcibly searched and their cellphones were confiscated.",
