        "In addition to this, there is a separate instrument regarding the marriage.",
        "Vanessa proposed merging part of the future income, investment rights, and voting rights of both parties, euphemistically calling it the \"Carter-Mitchell Family Partnership.\"",
        "Ethan will continue to be a nominal share holder.",
        "Vanessa, on the other hand, has co-management rights.",
        "Her father's advisory firm will be solely responsible for investment strategy.",
        "Patricia's charitable foundation receives an annual \"community development\" grant.",
        "\"Has your personal attorney reviewed these?\" I asked.",
        "\"Vanessa said that seeking a lawyer would only make the originally harmonious relationship between the in-laws and family become hostile.\"",
        "“Our lawyers exist because love can never replace legal definitions in black and white.”",
        "Ethan stared at the signature line.",
        "Below the signature, there is nothing.",
        "\"When was I supposed to sign?\"",
        "\"After the engagement toast was delivered,\" he said.",
        "George originally planned to give a short speech after three rounds of drinks, grandly announcing that the addition of Mitchell Development Company was a milestone for Carter Hospitality to move towards a \"new era\".",
        "Once it is announced publicly in front of investors and business celebrities, and if you try to refuse in the future, it will be slandered by the outside world as an internal crisis within the family.",
        "This kind of pressure is simply a well-planned conspiracy.",
        "Fortunately, Ethan hadn't put pen to paper yet.",
        "This is a blessing in misfortune.",
        "But he is equally responsible for allowing these conflict-of-interest documents to advance to this point without board review.",
        "At this moment, Vanessa opened the door and walked in with Patricia and George.",
        "She had changed out of the water-stained dress.",
        "Eyes red and swollen.",
        "\"Can we talk alone?\" she asked Ethan.",
        "\"Can't.\"",
        "She looked at me coldly.",
        "\"Have you publicly humiliated me enough?\"",
        "I almost laughed out loud.",
        "\"A few minutes ago, I was kneeling beneath the stream from your hose.\"",
        "\"You deliberately disguised yourself to test me.\"",
        "\"Yes.\"",
        "\"This is so insidious.\"",
        "\"Yes.\"",
        "This confession stunned everyone present.",
        "I made no moral defense of my disguise.",
        "\"I should have investigated you privately and through more formal compliance channels. But that doesn't mean you were innocent of what you did in the garden tonight.\"",
        "Vanessa crossed her arms.",
        "\"You just want to see me make a fool of myself.\"",
        "\"I just wanted to see if those employees were baseless when they said you were cruel.\"",
        "\"They hate me because I have principles and standards.\"",
        "\"Luis just handed a tissue to a confused stranger.\"",
        "\"He disobeyed my orders.\"",
        "\"You have no right to order him.\"",
        "\"I'm the one who's going to marry Ethan.\"",
        "Ethan's face completely sank.",
        "Vanessa didn't realize until then that she had let the slip.",
        "She hurriedly reached out to grab his hand.",
