        "Ethan, on the other hand, chose to pretend to be deaf and dumb all the way before the cruel truth hit his head.",
        "## Chapter 4: The Recording They Tried to Hide",
        "Early the next morning, a public statement issued in Vanessa's name suddenly leaked online.",
        "\"Yesterday, an unidentified person entered our private engagement celebration under a false identity and verbally threatened my family after repeated requests to leave. To prevent further escalation, on-site staff used a garden hose to remove the trespasser. We later learned that the incident was staged by a relative who opposed the marriage.\"",
        "In this statement, the words \"beating,\" \"beggar,\" and \"body search\" were not mentioned at all.",
        "The water was not \"splashed\" but \"accidentally touched\".",
        "Every word in the statement implies that I directed and performed a painful trick in order to ruin Ethan's marriage.",
        "Public opinion on the Internet was instantly polarized.",
        "Some people believed me because the church video showed Ethan holding my wrist tightly.",
        "Others insisted that I was deliberately setting up a trap to humiliate my future daughter-in-law.",
        "My wealth at this moment became the biggest original sin to absolve myself of any crime.",
        "Online comment sections are filled with conspiracy theories: Why would a billionaire woman dress up in disguise to test a prospective daughter-in-law? Isn't this the bad taste of the powerful class?",
        "I issued a brief statement through my law firm that was reviewed by legal counsel:",
        "The reason why I concealed my identity and went to the site was because many employees had previously complained with their real names about being treated poorly and faced retaliation. My conduct has been reviewed by an independent ethics committee. The on-site recordings and relevant witness statements will be handed over to relevant investigation agencies in accordance with the law. No one's socioeconomic status should give him or her the privilege to trample on the dignity of others or inflict violence.",
        "I did not post the live video directly online.",
        "Because the video shows Lewis’s face.",
        "Other employees also have their own privacy rights.",
        "The entire video was eventually handed over to an independent forensic appraisal agency.",
        "The metadata confirms the integrity of the recording and that it has not been edited in any way.",
        "As the investigation progressed, more videos were unearthed.",
        "One of the surveillance videos showed that Vanessa was standing under the rose arch and whispering to George ten minutes before Luis and I showed up.",
        "\"If Ethan continues to delay the renovation vote, sign the Family Partnership Agreement before the vote,\" she said at the time.",
        "George replied: \"As long as the engagement is publicly announced, the board of directors will not embarrass him even if it is for the sake of the overall situation.\"",
        "Patricia added on the side: \"When she gets married, Ethan's mother will naturally become the evil mother-in-law who gets in the way and meddles in other people's business. There will be plenty of ways to deal with her then.\"",
        "Although this conversation does not constitute a direct crime of financial fraud.",
        "But it completely confirms that there is a high degree of collusion of interests between business contracts and marriage agreements.",
        "Compliance reviews within the group have been completely upgraded.",
        "All past project invoices of Mitchell Development Company were turned upside down.",
        "Many subcontractors have reported that when undertaking projects in the past, they were often forced to make false bids, and then had to secretly return the difference to a designated account in the name of \"consulting fees.\"",
        "Even a hotel renovation project in Memphis had a safety incident. Eight months ago, construction worker Samuel Ortiz fell from a height when a bracket broke during construction.",
        "Although he survived, his spine was severely damaged.",
        "At that time, Mitchell Development Company insisted that Samuel did not fasten his seat belt, which was an illegal operation.",
        "However, internal inspection photos showed that the broken bracket itself had been severely aged and cracked, and was not an original compliant building component at all.",
        "George's company privately reached a confidential compensation agreement with Samuel.",
        "Although the compensation is in place, the condition is that a sealing agreement must be signed.",
        "What’s even more frightening is that the on-site safety inspection records evaporated from the project files.",
        "A former project manager at Mitchell secretly kept the backup.",
        "Email records show that it was Patricia who was behind the incident.",
        "\"We have a unified voice to the outside world and put all the responsibility on the workers for improper operation. We will never discuss the replacement of materials before the lawyer approves the final statement.\"",
        "Vanessa also participated in the reply to this email.",
        "Her reply was only four words:",
        "“Making workers a target.”",
        "It was this line of text that escalated the whole matter from simple workplace bullying to a premeditated criminal offense.",
        "When powerless low-level employees threaten the reputation of the Mitchell family, they never reflect on what went wrong, but habitually plunge the other party into an abyss of eternal destruction.",
        "Vanessa attacks Samuel.",
        "Attack Luis.",
        "Now, she swung the butcher knife at me.",
        "However, she never expected that she would end up provoking the wrong person at the last moment.",
        "She was stupid enough to send Luis a message directly.",
        "That was a voice message sent to Luis’ cell phone at 11:43 in the night:",
        "\"You have no idea what happened that day. If you dare to talk nonsense, any of Carter's industries will never hire you again. Before you choose to side with a strange old woman who talks lies, think carefully about your own future.\"",
        "Luis retained this voice line intact.",
        "He didn't reply.",
        "This panic message full of threats directly pushed a simple workplace bullying to the edge of a felony of \"obstructing justice and intimidating witnesses.\"",
        "Vanessa's lawyer saw this and immediately told her to shut up.",
        "But in a panic, she sent two more messages in quick succession.",
        "By this time, a mere engagement party incident had already become the first piece to crush the Mitchell family's dominoes.",
        "## Chapter 5: The Truth Ethan Refused to Face",
        "Ethan submitted an application to the Board of Directors to temporarily resign from the Project Committee.",
        "The board asked him to hand over procurement approval authority during the review because he concealed material interests in Mitchell's proposal.",
        "At first he felt extremely wronged.",
        "\"I didn't sign.\"",
        "\"You are secretly promoting the transfer of benefits while you are engaged to your partner's daughter. This is a violation,\" the chairman of the compliance committee responded coldly.",
        "\"Everyone knew we were in a relationship.\"",
        "\"Being in a relationship does not mean that you are exempt from the compliance disclosure obligations of initialing large voting rights, taking commissions on family assets, and conveying hidden benefits.\"",
        "After the review, Ethan came to my house with his briefcase.",
        "He looked exhausted.",
        "\"They're now scrutinizing me like I'm a fellow fraudster.\"",
        "\"They are trying to figure out what role you played in this farce.\"",
        "\"I thought that contract was legal.\"",
        "\"Then the independent review will give you the answer.\"",
        "\"You actually voted for suspension.\"",
