        "\"You can definitely defend me.\"",
        "\"As a mother?\"",
        "\"Yes.\"",
        "\"That's why an independent third party has to step in.\"",
        "He paced restlessly back and forth in my study.",
        "\"Losing decision-making power felt like a punishment.\"",
        "\"This may also be a form of late protection.\"",
        "Ethan sat down across from me.",
        "After experiencing this series of storms, he finally no longer looks like a high-ranking executive, but like a little boy who broke the neighbor's window but didn't dare to admit it.",
        "\"Why didn't I notice it before?\"",
        "\"Because Vanessa's cruelty has always provided you with emotional value and a comfort zone.\"",
        "His head jerked up.",
        "\"She helps you clean up those difficult roles that are giving you headaches. She beats people into submission before you complain. She interprets all warnings as people being jealous of you. And you call it efficiency.\"",
        "\"I loved her.\"",
        "\"I know.\"",
        "\"Then did she love me?\"",
        "\"I can't quantify the complexity of her feelings.\"",
        "\"You always make sense.\"",
        "\"No. I just learned to completely separate 'emotion' and 'behavior'.\"",
        "He cast his gaze out the window.",
        "\"I initially ignored Luis's complaint.\"",
        "\"You accepted Vanessa's one-sided statement in full.\"",
        "\"She said that guy just wanted money.\"",
        "\"All he was asking for was for her to stop humiliating him.\"",
        "\"Samuel's injuries on the construction site also occurred under the nose of the company I recommended.\"",
        "\"You really don't know at the time that they secretly replaced inferior stents.\"",
        "\"I'm just too lazy to ask why their bid was so ridiculously low.\"",
        "This is the truth that Ethan really needs to face.",
        "Although he was not directly involved in the fraud.",
        "But he used his indifference and arrogance to protect those who did evil.",
        "Ultimately, the board of directors concluded the investigation that Ethan had seriously violated the conflict of interest disclosure principles and procurement compliance disciplines.",
        "Although there is no conclusive evidence that he knew the law, violated the law, and participated in false invoices.",
        "But he was stripped of his title of executive vice president for a year and demoted to a rank-and-file director responsible for regional operations with compliance oversight.",
        "Some relatives called me privately to accuse me, saying that I didn't even care about my own son's future because of official business.",
        "My answer is simple:",
        "\"If he still has leadership qualities despite the scrutiny, compliance and accountability will only make him stronger. If he doesn't, then my motherly love must never override the safety of our employees.\"",
        "The Carter-Mitchell family's renovation contract was completely torn up.",
        "All projects undertaken by Mitchell have been suspended and will undergo a series of safety and financial inspections.",
        "We didn't violently fire everyone at Mitchell's company.",
        "Many lower-level workers are innocent and count on this salary to support their families.",
        "An independent trustee took over the semi-paralyzed construction sites and moved forward steadily while ensuring safety.",
        "As for the case of Samuel Ortiz, it has also been reopened.",
        "In the face of irrefutable evidence, Mitchell Development Company finally reached a huge settlement compensation out of civil court.",
        "This compensation cannot allow Samuel to get back on his feet.",
        "Money can never make up for the disability of neglect.",
        "The day I met Samuel, I apologized to him.",
        "“Our company’s lax review of projects cannot be blamed for this.”",
        "Samuel looked at me: \"You didn't change the bracket secretly.\"",
        "\"No. But our supervision is lacking.\"",
        "He turned his head and glanced at Ethan sitting beside him.",
        "\"When they said I didn't fasten my seat belt, did you believe it?\"",
        "Ethan replied honestly: \"I believe it.\"",
        "\"Why?\"",
        "“Because it’s much easier to trust a company’s investigative report than to question it.”",
        "Samuel smiled bitterly.",
        "\"This answer sounds really heartbreaking.\"",
        "\"I know.\"",
        "\"No, you're just starting to really understand now.\"",
        "There was no touching drama of burying the hatchet in this meeting.",
        "The essence of accountability is never to rely on the victim's forgiveness to reduce the perpetrator's sentence.",
        "Luis stayed.",
        "Not only did I stay, I secured legal protection for him from any form of retaliation and promoted him into our executive training program under unusual circumstances.",
        "When I thanked him in the garden for showing up, he looked uncomfortable.",
        "\"I almost turned around and left.\"",
        "\"You did take a step back.\"",
        "\"Vanessa threatened to fire me.\"",
        "\"Then what?\"",
        "\"I think of my grandma.\"",
